# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# Every icon slot of home screen page 1 and the dock opened for 5 s and closed with the home button (devices/akita TODO 58:
# what crashes or does not draw) -- the host takes screenshots meanwhile (tools/usbmux-shot.py every 4 s) and the
# logs are read for the Metal plug-in's refusals, GPU faults and crashes. A slot's tap: row by row, left to right.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 8
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.150 0.12 wait 5 button home wait 2 button home wait 1 tap 0.385 0.12 wait 5 button home wait 2 button home wait 1 tap 0.615 0.12 wait 5 button home wait 2 button home wait 1 tap 0.845 0.12 wait 5 button home wait 2 button home wait 1
